pageType\":\"post\"}},\"isAuthenticatedSite\":false,\"className\":\"lg:-order-1\"}],false,false]}]\n"])</script><script nonce="cWhJcXvSd8HJc2ApEueWcg==">self.__next_f.push([1,"81:I[98487,[\"9954\",\"$1b\",\"6446\",\"$1c\",\"5288\",\"$1d\",\"433\",\"$1e\",\"2602\",\"$1f\",\"5196\",\"$20\",\"5939\",\"$21\",\"2058\",\"$22\",\"8131\",\"$23\",\"3431\",\"$36\",\"9783\",\"$37\",\"5369\",\"$24\",\"3593\",\"$25\",\"5664\",\"$26\",\"1163\",\"$3b\",\"6704\",\"$3c\",\"9999\",\"$30\",\"9310\",\"$3d\",\"3244\",\"$3e\",\"4749\",\"$3f\",\"4728\",\"$40\",\"3278\",\"$41\",\"86\",\"$42\",\"2166\",\"$38\",\"3058\",\"$27\",\"2379\",\"$28\",\"7401\",\"$43\",\"2979\",\"$44\",\"3786\",\"$45\",\"2473\",\"$46\",\"732\",\"$47\",\"5487\",\"$48\",\"5035\",\"$49\",\"6855\",\"$4a\"],\"Feed\"]\n82:T485,@channel Hey Lumers, today we’re launching Relume Studio!\n\nYou can now generate on-brand images with the same people, places and look every time, right inside Relume.\n\nMost AI image tools give you one great picture, then the face changes, the room moves and everything starts looking generic.\n\nStudio fixes that: lock it in once, and every image after stays true.\n\n → Styles lock the look. Framing, eye line and tone, across photography, illustration, graphics and mocks.\n → Characters lock the people. A few photos become a full reference sheet, so it’s the same face in every image.\n → Scenes lock the place. One photo of your space becomes four locked angles.\n→ Everything lands straight in your Publish library. Ready to drop into your site\n\nPS: Styles can be shared publicly, so you can use styles other Lumers have built or share your own.\n\nYou can watch the full demo here: youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE (https://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE)\nLearn more here: relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio (https://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio)\n\nTry it out and let us know what you think! Studio is included in your Relume Pro account83:T493,\u003c!channel\u003e Hey Lumers, today we’re launching *Relume Studio!*\n\nYou can now generate on-brand images with the same people, places and look every time, right inside Relume.\n\nMost AI image tools give you one great picture, then the face changes, the room moves and everything starts looking generic.\n\nStudio fixes that: lock it in once, and every image after stays true.\n\n *→ Styles lock the look.* Framing, eye line and tone, across photography, illustration, graphics and mocks.\n *→ Characters lock the people.* A few photos become a full reference sheet, so it’s the same face in every image.\n *→ Scenes lock the place.* One photo of your space becomes four locked angles.\n*→ Everything lands straight in your Publish library.* Ready to drop into your site\n\nPS: Styles can be shared publicly, so you can use styles other Lumers have built or share your own.\n\nYou can watch the full demo here: \u003chttps://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE|youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\u003e\nLearn more here: \u003chttps://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio|relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\u003e\n\nTry it out and let us know what you think! *Studio is included in your Relume Pro account*84:T67b,@channel Hey Lumers, I'm excited to share we've just rolled out a big upgrade to Relume AI: Faster and better models across Publish and Export, and more than double the usage on every Pro plan ⚡\nBehind the scenes, we've been working closely with the leading AI labs and providers to unlock better performance and access to the latest frontier models at scale. Rather than relying on one model, we pick the best one for each job from across those labs, whether that's reading your existing site, writing copy or generating images. We run thousands of evals to make that call, so you keep getting the best experience possible.\nUpdates to Relume Publish\nFaster, better models for everyone - Free and Pro plans both get upgraded models. Our Premium models are now 2–3× faster, and as before, Pro plans have it on by default 🚀\n\nDouble the usage - We've more than doubled the AI usage on every Pro plan, so you can build, tweak and iterate more than ever. Running low on usage? Our new model picker lets you switch to Standard so your usage goes even further 📈\n\nI want to make sure you all get to experience these improvements ASAP so I've gone ahead and reset the usage limits on every Pro plan (Don't tell @Dan 🤫)\nUpdates to Relume Export\nImproved output across all tasks - Output quality across all tasks is up by 30%+ on our evaluation criteria 💪🏼 \n\nAI performance now 3x to 5× faster - Sitemaps, wireframes, copy, and styles now generate in a fraction of the time. To visualise the difference I've attached a sped-up gif of wireframing before and after ⚡\n\nJump in and give it a go. We can't wait to see what you build with it ❤️ 🚀85:T6e1,\u003c!channel\u003e Hey Lumers, I'm excited to share we've just rolled out a big upgrade to Relume AI: *Faster and better models across Publish and Export, and more than double the usage on every Pro plan* :zap:\n\nBehind the scenes, we've been working closely with the leading AI labs and providers to unlock better performance and access to the latest frontier models at scale. Rather than relying on one model, we pick the best one for each job from across those labs, whether that's reading your existing site, writing copy or generating images. We run thousands of evals to make that call, so you keep getting the best experience possible.\n\n*Updates to Relume Publish*\n• *Faster, better models for everyone -* Free and Pro plans both get upgraded models. Our Premium models are now 2–3× faster, and as before, Pro plans have it on by default :rocket:\n• *Double the usage -* We've more than doubled the AI usage on every Pro plan, so you can build, tweak and iterate more than ever. Running low on usage? Our new model picker lets you switch to Standard so your usage goes even further :chart_with_upwards_trend: \nI want to make sure you all get to experience these improvements ASAP so I've gone ahead and reset the usage limits on every Pro plan (Don't tell \u003c@U02MK9HPSG6\u003e :shushing_face:)\n\n*Updates to Relume Export*\n• *Improved output across all tasks -* Output quality across all tasks is up by 30%+ on our evaluation criteria :muscle::skin-tone-3: \n• *AI performance now 3x to 5× faster -* Sitemaps, wireframes, copy, and styles now generate in a fraction of the time. To visualise the difference I've attached a sped-up gif of wireframing before and after :zap: \nJump in and give it a go. We can't wait to see what you build with it :heart: :rocket:67:[\"$\",\"$L81\",null,{\"tenantId\":\"5525a274-abb9-4bfb-ace8-b3c9efc62c22\",\"feedIdOrName\":\"home\",\"defaultFeedPostUiFormat\":\"snippet\",\"defaultSortMethod\":\"newest\",\"defaultPageSize\":10,\"fallbackData\":{\"page\":0,\"pageSize\":10,\"records\":[{\"id\":\"815rg6l704dq\",\"message_id\":\"msg_qyYQ0OgB5wJb\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-06T10:44:05.953196+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-06T10:44:02.89+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-06T10:44:02.89+00:00\",\"title\":\"Site Health checker doesn't recognise CMS images or collection-page article links\",\"slug\":\"site-health-checker-doesnt-recognise-cms-images-or\",\"description\":\"Site Health checker misses CMS article links and images, reporting false positives that obscure genuine issues on collection pages and blog posts.\",\"feed_id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"3d1bc4fb-213e-42bc-8ad7-104a32e311be\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Bug report (minor inconvenience): CMS\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"images and collection-page links to articles are not recognised by “Site Health” checker\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"My site has a CMS-based blog with a hub page that automatically builds the article preview, linking to the corresponding article.  The articles themselves have both a canonical “featured image” and inline images and video light boxes within the article rich text.  Everything works perfectly; but the site health checker appears not to see the links to the articles, or the images which it reads as placeholders.  This then makes the site health checker useless for me, since any real health issue is masked by the false positives.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Bug report (minor inconvenience): CMS images and collection-page links to articles are not recognised by “Site Health” checker\\nMy site has a CMS-based blog with a hub page that automatically builds the article preview, linking to the corresponding article.  The articles themselves have both a canonical “featured image” and inline images and video light boxes within the article rich text.  Everything works perfectly; but the site health checker appears not to see the links to the articles, or the images which it reads as placeholders.  This then makes the site health checker useless for me, since any real health issue is masked by the false positives.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":0,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"7423ceb8-6d41-4602-b85e-629262daae84\",\"message_ts\":\"1793961842.890059\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"1omh9\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Bug report (minor inconvenience): CMS\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"images and collection-page links to articles are not recognised by “Site Health” checker\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"\\nMy site has a CMS-based blog with a hub page that automatically builds the article preview, linking to the corresponding article.  The articles themselves have both a canonical “featured image” and inline images and video light boxes within the article rich text.  Everything works perfectly; but the site health checker appears not to see the links to the articles, or the images which it reads as placeholders.  This then makes the site health checker useless for me, since any real health issue is masked by the false positives.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"*Bug report (minor inconvenience): CMS* *images and collection-page links to articles are not recognised by “Site Health” checker*\\nMy site has a CMS-based blog with a hub page that automatically builds the article preview, linking to the corresponding article.  The articles themselves have both a canonical “featured image” and inline images and video light boxes within the article rich text.  Everything works perfectly; but the site health checker appears not to see the links to the articles, or the images which it reads as placeholders.  This then makes the site health checker useless for me, since any real health issue is masked by the false positives.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MK7D364W/p1793961842890059\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"3d1bc4fb-213e-42bc-8ad7-104a32e311be\",\"public_id\":\"prof_3hBRy36i2d37\",\"preferred_name\":\"thomas.sutton\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U0CEJ0PAV2M\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U0CEJ0PAV2M\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"public_id\":\"feed_xTZoCfbr4ZGz\",\"label\":\"Feedback\",\"slug\":\"feedback\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"rofkmr5gbog1\",\"message_id\":\"msg_6o8EpIf1RD8g\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-05T17:39:54.564643+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-05T17:39:50.282+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-05T17:42:37.307+00:00\",\"title\":\"Are free hosted sites on Publish searchable in search engines?\",\"slug\":\"are-free-hosted-sites-on-publish-searchable-in-sea\",\"description\":\"Learn whether free Relume-hosted sites are indexed by search engines and how to restrict access to stakeholders with the link.\",\"feed_id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"d15d1034-8e2a-45d2-a817-c8f6eef22573\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Are the free hosted sites (\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"www.website.relumesite.ai\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"http://www.website.relumesite.ai\"}}]},{\"text\":\") on Publish searchable in search engines? If they are, is there a way to turn that off? I’m looking to share a website with key stakeholders to get apprval and only wanted it accessible is an individual has the link.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Are the free hosted sites (www.website.relumesite.ai) on Publish searchable in search engines? If they are, is there a way to turn that off? I’m looking to share a website with key stakeholders to get apprval and only wanted it accessible is an individual has the link.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":2,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"d783be8b-9a7c-4feb-90f3-c0c600d44647\",\"message_ts\":\"1793900390.282989\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"DY0uL\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Are the free hosted sites (\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"url\":\"http://www.website.relumesite.ai\",\"text\":\"www.website.relumesite.ai\",\"type\":\"link\"},{\"text\":\") on Publish searchable in search engines? If they are, is there a way to turn that off? I’m looking to share a website with key stakeholders to get apprval and only wanted it accessible is an individual has the link.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"Are the free hosted sites (\u003chttp://www.website.relumesite.ai|www.website.relumesite.ai\u003e) on Publish searchable in search engines? If they are, is there a way to turn that off? I’m looking to share a website with key stakeholders to get apprval and only wanted it accessible is an individual has the link.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C030PMFM4GM/p1793900390282989\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"d15d1034-8e2a-45d2-a817-c8f6eef22573\",\"public_id\":\"prof_2fn0XkPHY7k6\",\"preferred_name\":\"Quinn B.\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/364f4ba94c24d902817f90d24e0533ba.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0016-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U071V647P7W\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U071V647P7W\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"public_id\":\"feed_0hWAYRH0ZJSs\",\"label\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[{\"url\":\"http://www.website.relumesite.ai\",\"is_image\":false,\"is_video\":false,\"order_seen\":0,\"is_embedded_media\":false}]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"5ukev7j9vjlp\",\"message_id\":\"msg_o4ReSpn3eG1V\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:45:39.731362+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:45:36.444+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-05T11:42:47.573+00:00\",\"title\":\"What chat box can send notifications and replies by text?\",\"slug\":\"what-chat-box-can-send-notifications-and-replies-b\",\"description\":\"Looking for a website chat box that sends notifications to owners and allows text responses? Explore top chat solutions here.\",\"feed_id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"75da9456-e3d4-41ee-be2c-ff70634446a6\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Does anyone know of a good chat box that can be put on a website that the owner can get notifications and respond via text?\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Does anyone know of a good chat box that can be put on a website that the owner can get notifications and respond via text?\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":4,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"42fb4f3d-430e-44de-87f3-d55c5057eaa8\",\"message_ts\":\"1793735136.444559\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"RcvAr\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Does anyone know of a good chat box that can be put on a website that the owner can get notifications and respond via text?\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"Does anyone know of a good chat box that can be put on a website that the owner can get notifications and respond via text?\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C030PMFM4GM/p1793735136444559\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"75da9456-e3d4-41ee-be2c-ff70634446a6\",\"public_id\":\"prof_tzBAc0MIXKCH\",\"preferred_name\":\"Sara M.\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b56ad3dd7eb7cd07c53d9c634ab0d68c.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0003-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U05R1AR9LP2\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U05R1AR9LP2\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"public_id\":\"feed_0hWAYRH0ZJSs\",\"label\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"kzjae0spa0zi\",\"message_id\":\"msg_kLBoWHsnSWN1\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:36:17.049045+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:36:13.928+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:36:13.928+00:00\",\"title\":\"I’d like to be able to create content globals for service times\",\"slug\":\"id-like-to-be-able-to-create-content-globals-for-s\",\"description\":\"Feature request to create content globals for managing consistent service times across a website to simplify updates and avoid errors.\",\"feed_id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"e7fdf1aa-e562-4928-a1d4-5404d5f6dc26\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Unrelated to above\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"…\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"It’d be nice to be able to create content globals. For my use-case, I have services times of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"9 \u0026 11:30 a.m.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"code\"}]},{\"text\":\" scattered all throughout my site. Anytime we change a service time for one day I’ll need to go hunt those all down. I guess I could ask an agent, but I’d be a little nervous something might get missed.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Unrelated to above… It’d be nice to be able to create content globals. For my use-case, I have services times of 9 \u0026 11:30 a.m. scattered all throughout my site. Anytime we change a service time for one day I’ll need to go hunt those all down. I guess I could ask an agent, but I’d be a little nervous something might get missed.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":\"2026-11-04T02:06:55.687+00:00\",\"version\":2,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":0,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"a7a83652-1bc9-4809-8984-dff0d888f619\",\"message_ts\":\"1793734573.928769\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"aaaHj\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Unrelated to above\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"…\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"It’d be nice to be able to create content globals. For my use-case, I have services times of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"9 \u0026 11:30 a.m.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"code\":true}},{\"text\":\" scattered all throughout my site. Anytime we change a service time for one day I’ll need to go hunt those all down. I guess I could ask an agent, but I’d be a little nervous something might get missed.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"Unrelated to above… It’d be nice to be able to create content globals. For my use-case, I have services times of `9 \u0026 11:30 a.m.` scattered all throughout my site. Anytime we change a service time for one day I’ll need to go hunt those all down. I guess I could ask an agent, but I’d be a little nervous something might get missed.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MK7D364W/p1793734573928769\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"e7fdf1aa-e562-4928-a1d4-5404d5f6dc26\",\"public_id\":\"prof_OykXS2DnCpoH\",\"preferred_name\":\"Jesse B.\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U0BP3U31KH7\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U0BP3U31KH7\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"public_id\":\"feed_xTZoCfbr4ZGz\",\"label\":\"Feedback\",\"slug\":\"feedback\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"rbnkgo3byk1q\",\"message_id\":\"msg_9B3sDKzGE6yY\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:31:21.023332+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:31:17.92+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-03T19:31:17.92+00:00\",\"title\":\"Can I use URLs that don’t follow my site structure?\",\"slug\":\"can-i-use-urls-that-dont-follow-my-site-structure\",\"description\":\"Discussing challenges with maintaining flexible URLs while using sitemaps to organize site structure and calls to action.\",\"feed_id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"e7fdf1aa-e562-4928-a1d4-5404d5f6dc26\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"I like the ability to create a sitemap and structure my site for organizational purposes, but I don’t love being tied to those same structures for urls. Many of our pages are used as small call to actions in person.. like \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"/events\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"code\"}]},{\"text\":\" or \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"/alpha\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"code\"}]},{\"text\":\". I could add redirects, but that doesn’t seem like a good solution either.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"I like the ability to create a sitemap and structure my site for organizational purposes, but I don’t love being tied to those same structures for urls. Many of our pages are used as small call to actions in person.. like /events or /alpha. I could add redirects, but that doesn’t seem like a good solution either.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":0,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"088d2705-2c22-4468-9b87-05711ba3bb39\",\"message_ts\":\"1793734277.920269\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"+kVV2\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"I like the ability to create a sitemap and structure my site for organizational purposes, but I don’t love being tied to those same structures for urls. Many of our pages are used as small call to actions in person.. like \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"/events\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"code\":true}},{\"text\":\" or \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"/alpha\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"code\":true}},{\"text\":\". I could add redirects, but that doesn’t seem like a good solution either.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"I like the ability to create a sitemap and structure my site for organizational purposes, but I don’t love being tied to those same structures for urls. Many of our pages are used as small call to actions in person.. like `/events` or `/alpha`. I could add redirects, but that doesn’t seem like a good solution either.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MK7D364W/p1793734277920269\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"e7fdf1aa-e562-4928-a1d4-5404d5f6dc26\",\"public_id\":\"prof_OykXS2DnCpoH\",\"preferred_name\":\"Jesse B.\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2bb44317744228ac5c14eec27c304b11.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0017-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U0BP3U31KH7\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U0BP3U31KH7\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"public_id\":\"feed_xTZoCfbr4ZGz\",\"label\":\"Feedback\",\"slug\":\"feedback\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"7eprquvutghr\",\"message_id\":\"msg_vOOOjvpY6HRq\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T16:39:04.208732+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T16:39:00.346+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-04T09:49:37.857+00:00\",\"title\":\"Introducing Relume Studio, now included in Relume Pro\",\"slug\":\"introducing-relume-studio-now-included-in-relume-p\",\"description\":\"Relume Studio launches for consistent on-brand images with locked styles, characters, and scenes, all integrated into your Publish library.\",\"feed_id\":\"229ed736-f5d5-464e-a404-8418113b1359\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"7e30c86e-8d6e-4c9d-818c-1d3d06cfae79\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"@channel\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" Hey Lumers, today we’re launching \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Relume Studio!\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You can now generate on-brand images with the same people, places and look every time, right inside Relume.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Most AI image tools give you one great picture, then the face changes, the room moves and everything starts looking generic.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Studio fixes that: lock it in once, and every image after stays true.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\" → Styles lock the look. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"Framing, eye line and tone, across photography, illustration, graphics and mocks.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\" → Characters lock the people.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" A few photos become a full reference sheet, so it’s the same face in every image.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\" → Scenes lock the place. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"One photo of your space becomes four locked angles.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"→ Everything lands straight in your Publish library.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Ready to drop into your site\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"PS: Styles can be shared publicly, so you can use styles other Lumers have built or share your own.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You can watch the full demo here: \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\"}}]},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"Learn more here: \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Try it out and let us know what you think! \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Studio is included in your Relume Pro account\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"$82\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":\"2026-11-03T16:58:46.22+00:00\",\"version\":1,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":19,\"comments_count\":6,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"0f1aa3dc-b969-426e-9037-c4d75177dac9\",\"message_ts\":\"1793723940.346909\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"A9Exc\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"broadcast\",\"range\":\"channel\"},{\"text\":\" Hey Lumers, today we’re launching \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Relume Studio!\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"\\n\\nYou can now generate on-brand images with the same people, places and look every time, right inside Relume.\\n\\nMost AI image tools give you one great picture, then the face changes, the room moves and everything starts looking generic.\\n\\nStudio fixes that: lock it in once, and every image after stays true.\\n\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" → Styles lock the look. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"Framing, eye line and tone, across photography, illustration, graphics and mocks.\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" → Characters lock the people.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" A few photos become a full reference sheet, so it’s the same face in every image.\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" → Scenes lock the place. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"One photo of your space becomes four locked angles.\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"→ Everything lands straight in your Publish library.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" Ready to drop into your site\\n\\nPS: Styles can be shared publicly, so you can use styles other Lumers have built or share your own.\\n\\nYou can watch the full demo here: \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\",\"text\":\"youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\",\"type\":\"link\",\"truncated\":true},{\"text\":\"\\nLearn more here: \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"url\":\"https://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\",\"text\":\"relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\",\"type\":\"link\",\"unsafe\":true,\"truncated\":true},{\"text\":\"\\n\\nTry it out and let us know what you think! \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Studio is included in your Relume Pro account\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"$83\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MRTJJEM9/p1793723940346909\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"7e30c86e-8d6e-4c9d-818c-1d3d06cfae79\",\"public_id\":\"prof_2L4xbAxXpsEZ\",\"preferred_name\":\"Dan\",\"preferred_image_original\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_original.png\",\"preferred_image_1024\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_1024.png\",\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U02MK9HPSG6\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U02MK9HPSG6\",\"is_admin\":true,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"229ed736-f5d5-464e-a404-8418113b1359\",\"public_id\":\"feed_coT2tDOEJLY7\",\"label\":\"Announcements\",\"slug\":\"announcements\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[{\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE\",\"is_image\":false,\"is_video\":false,\"order_seen\":0,\"is_embedded_media\":false},{\"url\":\"https://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio\",\"is_image\":false,\"is_video\":false,\"order_seen\":1,\"is_embedded_media\":false}]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"bb35hb6gptog\",\"message_id\":\"msg_0g7py8mpoxan\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T13:26:44.013295+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T13:26:41.274+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-06T10:31:59.296+00:00\",\"title\":\"Bing Webmaster Tools reports missing alt text despite it being present\",\"slug\":\"bing-webmaster-tools-reports-missing-alt-text-desp\",\"description\":\"Bing Webmaster Tools incorrectly reports missing alt text despite all images having proper descriptive alt attributes on the site.\",\"feed_id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"3d1bc4fb-213e-42bc-8ad7-104a32e311be\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Alt text - false positive from Bing webmaster tools\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"I can see by inspecting the published site in the browser that alt text has been correctly added for every image.  However Bing webmaster tools (don't laugh, it's important for ChatGPT) claims alt text is missing with the following diagnostic: \\\"The \u003cimg\u003e tag does not have an ALT attribute defined. As a general rule, search engines do not interpret the content of image files. The text provided in the \u003cimg alt\u003e attribute enables the site owner to provide relevant information to the search engine and to the end user. Alt text is helpful to end users if they have images disabled or if the image does not properly load. In addition, the Alt text is utilized by screen readers. Make sure that your Alt text is descriptive and accurately reflects what the image represents and supports the content on the page.\\\" I don't know if it's a bug in Bing, or possibly a stylistic preference in the way the code is formatted, so just letting you know.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Alt text - false positive from Bing webmaster tools\\nI can see by inspecting the published site in the browser that alt text has been correctly added for every image.  However Bing webmaster tools (don't laugh, it's important for ChatGPT) claims alt text is missing with the following diagnostic: \\\"The \u003cimg\u003e tag does not have an ALT attribute defined. As a general rule, search engines do not interpret the content of image files. The text provided in the \u003cimg alt\u003e attribute enables the site owner to provide relevant information to the search engine and to the end user. Alt text is helpful to end users if they have images disabled or if the image does not properly load. In addition, the Alt text is utilized by screen readers. Make sure that your Alt text is descriptive and accurately reflects what the image represents and supports the content on the page.\\\" I don't know if it's a bug in Bing, or possibly a stylistic preference in the way the code is formatted, so just letting you know.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":6,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"91ebfbb0-37ef-4bce-83b7-202c53bf1f4a\",\"message_ts\":\"1793712401.274929\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"MAODz\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Alt text - false positive from Bing webmaster tools\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"\\nI can see by inspecting the published site in the browser that alt text has been correctly added for every image.  However Bing webmaster tools (don't laugh, it's important for ChatGPT) claims alt text is missing with the following diagnostic: \\\"The \u003cimg\u003e tag does not have an ALT attribute defined. As a general rule, search engines do not interpret the content of image files. The text provided in the \u003cimg alt\u003e attribute enables the site owner to provide relevant information to the search engine and to the end user. Alt text is helpful to end users if they have images disabled or if the image does not properly load. In addition, the Alt text is utilized by screen readers. Make sure that your Alt text is descriptive and accurately reflects what the image represents and supports the content on the page.\\\" I don't know if it's a bug in Bing, or possibly a stylistic preference in the way the code is formatted, so just letting you know.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"*Alt text - false positive from Bing webmaster tools*\\nI can see by inspecting the published site in the browser that alt text has been correctly added for every image.  However Bing webmaster tools (don't laugh, it's important for ChatGPT) claims alt text is missing with the following diagnostic: \\\"The \u0026lt;img\u0026gt; tag does not have an ALT attribute defined. As a general rule, search engines do not interpret the content of image files. The text provided in the \u0026lt;img alt\u0026gt; attribute enables the site owner to provide relevant information to the search engine and to the end user. Alt text is helpful to end users if they have images disabled or if the image does not properly load. In addition, the Alt text is utilized by screen readers. Make sure that your Alt text is descriptive and accurately reflects what the image represents and supports the content on the page.\\\" I don't know if it's a bug in Bing, or possibly a stylistic preference in the way the code is formatted, so just letting you know.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MK7D364W/p1793712401274929\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"3d1bc4fb-213e-42bc-8ad7-104a32e311be\",\"public_id\":\"prof_3hBRy36i2d37\",\"preferred_name\":\"thomas.sutton\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b33aa81820625e59c06b4bad163cf4d5.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0026-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U0CEJ0PAV2M\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U0CEJ0PAV2M\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"5ccd2689-0e2a-4947-b4ff-9fa82a49f60f\",\"public_id\":\"feed_xTZoCfbr4ZGz\",\"label\":\"Feedback\",\"slug\":\"feedback\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"8ggokcnypz4e\",\"message_id\":\"msg_mFwtGUeMYJ3n\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T11:06:22.566562+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T11:06:19.142+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-03T11:56:38.505+00:00\",\"title\":\"Will Relume offer native integration with Client-first v3?\",\"slug\":\"will-relume-offer-native-integration-with-client-f\",\"description\":\"Discussion about plans for a new Relume version with native Client-first v3 integration to simplify class mapping.\",\"feed_id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"86f069c8-13b2-4b5b-b8d3-d4062b9e3851\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Are there any plans for a new Relume version that offers Client-first v3 out-of-the-box native integration without having to manually map Relume’s library classes into v3 variable structures?\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"Or would this be a pointless endeavour anyway?\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"Apologies if something similar already been asked, but I couldn’t find any references to the latest version of Client-first.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Are there any plans for a new Relume version that offers Client-first v3 out-of-the-box native integration without having to manually map Relume’s library classes into v3 variable structures?\\nOr would this be a pointless endeavour anyway?\\nApologies if something similar already been asked, but I couldn’t find any references to the latest version of Client-first.\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":1,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"ef3c05e6-71ea-470b-8726-62a8ffcc1a22\",\"message_ts\":\"1793703979.142079\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"MhT+D\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Are there any plans for a new Relume version that offers Client-first v3 out-of-the-box native integration without having to manually map Relume’s library classes into v3 variable structures?\\nOr would this be a pointless endeavour anyway?\\nApologies if something similar already been asked, but I couldn’t find any references to the latest version of Client-first.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"Are there any plans for a new Relume version that offers Client-first v3 out-of-the-box native integration without having to manually map Relume’s library classes into v3 variable structures?\\nOr would this be a pointless endeavour anyway?\\nApologies if something similar already been asked, but I couldn’t find any references to the latest version of Client-first.\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C030PMFM4GM/p1793703979142079\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"86f069c8-13b2-4b5b-b8d3-d4062b9e3851\",\"public_id\":\"prof_w0ATziVRWmtp\",\"preferred_name\":\"Daniel N.\",\"preferred_image_original\":null,\"preferred_image_1024\":null,\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=512\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=192\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=72\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=32\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3144217c74a374633a7816917cc9b0fb.jpg?s=24\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0006-24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U04FW7GST5Y\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U04FW7GST5Y\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"public_id\":\"feed_0hWAYRH0ZJSs\",\"label\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"ybieyki5mfh1\",\"message_id\":\"msg_KsMi3tbSrKx7\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-03T08:59:12.565872+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-03T08:59:09.408+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-03T09:06:37.174+00:00\",\"title\":\"Can you turn a Relume Export project into a Publish one?\",\"slug\":\"can-you-turn-a-relume-export-project-into-a-publis\",\"description\":null,\"feed_id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"9ea31dbf-d2c6-49f1-ae36-2226eaac0da3\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Can you turn a Relume Export project into a Publish one?\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"Can you turn a Relume Export project into a Publish one?\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":0,\"reactions_count\":0,\"comments_count\":2,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"9384a70b-f690-45cc-a59f-f721352bd6ce\",\"message_ts\":\"1793696349.408879\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"my4eq\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Can you turn a Relume Export project into a Publish one?\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"Can you turn a Relume Export project into a Publish one?\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C030PMFM4GM/p1793696349408879\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":null,\"cover_image_url\":null,\"author\":{\"id\":\"9ea31dbf-d2c6-49f1-ae36-2226eaac0da3\",\"public_id\":\"prof_PvNGRkOx6NN5\",\"preferred_name\":\"Tsogt-Erdene E.\",\"preferred_image_original\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_original.png\",\"preferred_image_1024\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_1024.png\",\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-11-03/12487807817158_5f8828fe0bbda38bfc36_24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U0CF848V6F2\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U0CF848V6F2\",\"is_admin\":false,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"8cd14661-8ec5-470b-b8f5-cce9526a9e85\",\"public_id\":\"feed_0hWAYRH0ZJSs\",\"label\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[]},{\"id\":\"oatgc5g82e5t\",\"message_id\":\"msg_gnsU6OfLblve\",\"created_at\":\"2026-11-02T11:37:32.594133+00:00\",\"content_created_at\":\"2026-11-02T11:37:28.016+00:00\",\"latest_activity_at\":\"2026-11-03T01:43:28.491+00:00\",\"title\":\"Big Relume AI upgrade: faster models and more than double the usage on Pro plans\",\"slug\":\"big-relume-ai-upgrade-faster-models-and-more-than\",\"description\":\"Relume AI upgrade delivers faster models, doubled Pro plan usage, and improved export quality for better site building and copy generation.\",\"feed_id\":\"229ed736-f5d5-464e-a404-8418113b1359\",\"post_detail_display_format\":\"discussion\",\"author_profile_id\":\"9467c975-13f5-4f16-8a90-336dbd5c2936\",\"body_prosemirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"@channel\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" Hey Lumers, I'm excited to share we've just rolled out a big upgrade to Relume AI:\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" Faster and better models across Publish and Export, and more than double the usage on every Pro plan\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"⚡\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Behind the scenes, we've been working closely with the leading AI labs and providers to unlock better performance and access to the latest frontier models at scale. Rather than relying on one model, we pick the best one for each job from across those labs, whether that's reading your existing site, writing copy or generating images. We run thousands of evals to make that call, so you keep getting the best experience possible.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Updates to Relume Publish\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Faster, better models for everyone -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Free and Pro plans both get upgraded models. Our Premium models are now 2–3× faster, and as before, Pro plans have it on by default \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"🚀\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Double the usage - \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"We've more than doubled the AI usage on every Pro plan, so you can build, tweak and iterate more than ever. Running low on usage? Our new model picker lets you switch to Standard so your usage goes even further \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"📈\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"I want to make sure you all get to experience these improvements ASAP so I've gone ahead and reset the usage limits on every Pro plan (Don't tell \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"label\":\"Dan\",\"profile_id\":\"7e30c86e-8d6e-4c9d-818c-1d3d06cfae79\",\"slack_user_id\":\"U02MK9HPSG6\"}},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"🤫\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\")\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Updates to Relume Export\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Improved output across all tasks -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Output quality across all tasks is up by 30%+ on our evaluation criteria \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"💪🏼\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"AI performance now 3x to 5× faster -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Sitemaps, wireframes, copy, and styles now generate in a fraction of the time. To visualise the difference I've attached a sped-up gif of wireframing before and after \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"⚡\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"hardBreak\"},{\"text\":\"Jump in and give it a go. We can't wait to see what you build with it \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"❤️\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"🚀\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"body_plaintext\":\"$84\",\"source\":\"slack\",\"edited_at\":null,\"version\":0,\"is_published\":true,\"file_attachments_count\":1,\"reactions_count\":30,\"comments_count\":3,\"slack_message\":{\"id\":\"0094ec4b-6fee-4483-8509-ded6089b658f\",\"message_ts\":\"1793619448.016149\",\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text\",\"block_id\":\"GWPPH\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"broadcast\",\"range\":\"channel\"},{\"text\":\" Hey Lumers, I'm excited to share we've just rolled out a big upgrade to Relume AI:\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\" Faster and better models across Publish and Export, and more than double the usage on every Pro plan\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"zap\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"26a1\"},{\"text\":\"\\n\\nBehind the scenes, we've been working closely with the leading AI labs and providers to unlock better performance and access to the latest frontier models at scale. Rather than relying on one model, we pick the best one for each job from across those labs, whether that's reading your existing site, writing copy or generating images. We run thousands of evals to make that call, so you keep getting the best experience possible.\\n\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Updates to Relume Publish\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_list\",\"style\":\"bullet\",\"border\":0,\"indent\":0,\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Faster, better models for everyone -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" Free and Pro plans both get upgraded models. Our Premium models are now 2–3× faster, and as before, Pro plans have it on by default \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"1f680\"}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Double the usage - \",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"We've more than doubled the AI usage on every Pro plan, so you can build, tweak and iterate more than ever. Running low on usage? Our new model picker lets you switch to Standard so your usage goes even further \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"chart_with_upwards_trend\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"1f4c8\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"\\nI want to make sure you all get to experience these improvements ASAP so I've gone ahead and reset the usage limits on every Pro plan (Don't tell \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"user\",\"user_id\":\"U02MK9HPSG6\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"shushing_face\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"1f92b\"},{\"text\":\")\\n\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Updates to Relume Export\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\"\\n\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_list\",\"style\":\"bullet\",\"border\":0,\"indent\":0,\"elements\":[{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"Improved output across all tasks -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" Output quality across all tasks is up by 30%+ on our evaluation criteria \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"muscle\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"1f4aa-1f3fc\",\"skin_tone\":3},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"AI performance now 3x to 5× faster -\",\"type\":\"text\",\"style\":{\"bold\":true}},{\"text\":\" Sitemaps, wireframes, copy, and styles now generate in a fraction of the time. To visualise the difference I've attached a sped-up gif of wireframing before and after \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"zap\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"26a1\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"rich_text_section\",\"elements\":[{\"text\":\"\\nJump in and give it a go. We can't wait to see what you build with it \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"heart\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"2764-fe0f\"},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"name\":\"rocket\",\"type\":\"emoji\",\"unicode\":\"1f680\"}]}]}],\"markdown\":\"$85\",\"permalink\":\"https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MRTJJEM9/p1793619448016149\",\"parent_slack_message_id\":null,\"username\":null,\"icon\":null,\"is_shared\":false},\"cover_image_file_id\":\"6416a9be-7a67-408d-a555-90e484876fab\",\"cover_image_url\":\"https://files.tightknitusercontent.com/T02MRSR5LMQ/9467c975-13f5-4f16-8a90-336dbd5c2936/F0CE5KAELBT/Relume%20Export%20Wireframing.gif\",\"author\":{\"id\":\"9467c975-13f5-4f16-8a90-336dbd5c2936\",\"public_id\":\"prof_EvCTJGDWQWJf\",\"preferred_name\":\"Arman M.\",\"preferred_image_original\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_original.png\",\"preferred_image_1024\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_1024.png\",\"preferred_image_512\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_512.png\",\"preferred_image_192\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_192.png\",\"preferred_image_72\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_72.png\",\"preferred_image_48\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_48.png\",\"preferred_image_32\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_32.png\",\"preferred_image_24\":\"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_24.png\",\"slack_profile_id\":\"U097FBMFD8S\",\"is_team_member\":false,\"slack_profile\":{\"id\":\"U097FBMFD8S\",\"is_admin\":true,\"is_bot\":false,\"is_forgotten\":false,\"deleted\":false}},\"best_answer_message_id\":null,\"selected_answer_message_ids\":[],\"selected_answer_count\":0,\"feed\":{\"id\":\"229ed736-f5d5-464e-a404-8418113b1359\",\"public_id\":\"feed_coT2tDOEJLY7\",\"label\":\"Announcements\",\"slug\":\"announcements\",\"is_posting_from_site_allowed\":false,\"allow_selected_answer\":false,\"visibility\":\"public\",\"is_unlisted\":false},\"references\":{\"mentioned_slack_users\":[{\"public_id\":\"prof_2L4xbAxXpsEZ\",\"profile_id\":\"7e30c86e-8d6e-4c9d-818c-1d3d06cfae79\",\"slack_user_id\":\"U02MK9HPSG6\",\"preferred_name\":\"Dan\"}],\"mentioned_slack_channels\":[],\"custom_emojis\":[],\"urls\":[]},\"tags\":[],\"mentioned_profiles\":[{\"id\":\"7e30c86e-8d6e-4c9d-818c-1d3d06cfae79\",\"public_id\":\"prof_2L4xbAxXpsEZ\",\"preferred_name\":\"Dan\",\"opt_out_of_public_profile\":false}]}],\"count\":10,\"totalRecordsCount\":5682,\"totalPagesCount\":569,\"hasNextPage\":true},\"siteLogoUrl\":\"https://files.tightknitusercontent.com/T02MRSR5LMQ/11a88c24-8014-4636-87