v class="mb-4 mt-4"><h2 class="pr-0 sm:pr-2 md:pr-10"><a class="font-medium text-neutral-header hover:text-neutral-header-hover text-2xl" href="/x/feedback/msg_qyYQ0OgB5wJb/site-health-checker-doesnt-recognise-cms-images-or">Site Health checker doesn&#x27;t recognise CMS images or collection-page article links</a></h2></div><div class="max-h-[700px] body overflow-y-hidden"><div class="message-body relative w-full" data-testid="slack-blocks-body"><div id="slack_blocks_to_jsx" data-theme="light" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx relative flex gap-2 w-full max-w-[600px] styles_disabled"><div class="flex flex-col w-full"><div class="slack_blocks_to_jsx--blocks"><div class="text-base slack_blocks_to_jsx--block_wrapper break-words font-normal dark:text-dark-text-primary dark:bg-dark-bg-primary"><div id="1omh9" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Bug report (minor inconvenience): CMS</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">images and collection-page links to articles are not recognised by “Site Health” checker</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
My site has a CMS-based blog with a hub page that automatically builds the article preview, linking to the corresponding article.  The articles themselves have both a canonical “featured image” and inline images and video light boxes within the article rich text.  Everything works perfectly; but the site health checker appears not to see the links to the articles, or the images which it reads as placeholders.  This then makes the site health checker useless for me, since any real health issue is masked by the false positives.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[85px] -mt-[85px] bg-gradient-to-t from-background-card"></div><div class="text-link hover:text-link-hover w-full p-1 hover:cursor-pointer text-center">See more</div><div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t-2 border-card-border flex items-center space-x-2"><a title="0 comments" href="/x/feedback/msg_qyYQ0OgB5wJb/site-health-checker-doesnt-recognise-cms-images-or#comments"><div class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-message mr-1"><path d="M8 9h8"></path><path d="M8 13h6"></path><path d="M18 4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1 -3 3h-5l-5 3v-3h-2a3 3 0 0 1 -3 -3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3 -3h12"></path></svg><span class="">0<span class="hidden sm:inline ml-1">Comment<!-- -->s</span></span></div></a><button class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3" title="Share" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_t1d5bsnrisnnibtb_" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-share-3 mr-1"><path d="M13 4v4c-6.575 1.0