font-medium text-link hover:text-link-hover hover:underline">Jesse B.</span></a></div><span>·</span><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-skeleton h-4 w-[100px] rounded-card"></div><span>·</span><div><button title="View message in Slack" class="w-full plausible-event-name=tk-slack-permalink-click plausible-event-location=post-in-feed plausible-event-permalink=https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MK7D364W/p1793734573928769" data-testid="slack-permalink-button"><div title="View message in Slack" class="flex items-center p-1 hover:opacity-80"><img alt="Slack logo" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-5 h-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 1x, https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 2x" src="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg"/><span class="hidden">View in Slack</span></div></button></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-4"><h2 class="pr-0 sm:pr-2 md:pr-10"><a class="font-medium text-neutral-header hover:text-neutral-header-hover text-2xl" href="/x/feedback/msg_kLBoWHsnSWN1/id-like-to-be-able-to-create-content-globals-for-s">I’d like to be able to create content globals for service times</a></h2></div><div class="max-h-[700px] body overflow-y-hidden"><div class="message-body relative w-full" data-testid="slack-blocks-body"><div id="slack_blocks_to_jsx" data-theme="light" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx relative flex gap-2 w-full max-w-[600px] styles_disabled"><div class="flex flex-col w-full"><div class="slack_blocks_to_jsx--blocks"><div class="text-base slack_blocks_to_jsx--block_wrapper break-words font-normal dark:text-dark-text-primary dark:bg-dark-bg-primary"><div id="aaaHj" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">Unrelated to above</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">…</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">It’d be nice to be able to create content globals. For my use-case, I have services times of </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text slack_inline_code">9 &amp; 11:30 a.m.</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> scattered all throughout my site. Anytime we change a service time for one day I’ll need to go hunt those all down. I guess I could ask an agent, but I’d be a little nervous something might get missed.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[85px] -mt-[85px] bg-gradient-to-t from-background-card"></div><div class="text-link hover:text-link-hover w-full p-1 hover:cursor-pointer text-center">See more</div><div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t-2 border-card-border flex items-center space-x-2"><a title="0 comments" href="/x/feedback/msg_kLBoWHsnSWN1/id-like-to-be-able-to-create-content-globals-for-s#comments"><div class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-message mr-1"><path d="M8 9h8"></path><path d="M8 13h6"></path><path d="M18 4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1 -3 3h-5l-5 3v-3h-2a3 3 0 0 1 -3 -3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3 -3h12"></path></svg><span class="">0<span class="hidden sm:inline ml-1">Comment<!-- -->s</span></span></div></a><button class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3" title="Share" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_t4d5bsnrisnnibtb_" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler