n-cgi/image/width=1920,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_72.png 1920w, https://cdn.tightknit.ai/cdn-cgi/image/width=2048,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_72.png 2048w, https://cdn.tightknit.ai/cdn-cgi/image/width=3840,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_72.png 3840w" src="https://cdn.tightknit.ai/cdn-cgi/image/width=3840,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-08-31/11945041567985_2c131ab4d081f1285f5d_72.png"/></span><span class="font-medium text-link hover:text-link-hover hover:underline">Dan</span></a></div><span>·</span><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-skeleton h-4 w-[100px] rounded-card"></div><span>·</span><div><button title="View message in Slack" class="w-full plausible-event-name=tk-slack-permalink-click plausible-event-location=post-in-feed plausible-event-permalink=https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MRTJJEM9/p1793723940346909" data-testid="slack-permalink-button"><div title="View message in Slack" class="flex items-center p-1 hover:opacity-80"><img alt="Slack logo" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-5 h-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 1x, https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 2x" src="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg"/><span class="hidden">View in Slack</span></div></button></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-4"><h2 class="pr-0 sm:pr-2 md:pr-10"><a class="font-medium text-neutral-header hover:text-neutral-header-hover text-2xl" href="/x/announcements/msg_vOOOjvpY6HRq/introducing-relume-studio-now-included-in-relume-p">Introducing Relume Studio, now included in Relume Pro</a></h2></div><div class="max-h-[700px] body overflow-y-hidden"><div class="message-body relative w-full" data-testid="slack-blocks-body"><div id="slack_blocks_to_jsx" data-theme="light" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx relative flex gap-2 w-full max-w-[600px] styles_disabled"><div class="flex flex-col w-full"><div class="slack_blocks_to_jsx--blocks"><div class="text-base slack_blocks_to_jsx--block_wrapper break-words font-normal dark:text-dark-text-primary dark:bg-dark-bg-primary"><div id="A9Exc" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_broadcast slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_broadcast">@<!-- -->channel</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Hey Lumers, today we’re launching </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Relume Studio!</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">

You can now generate on-brand images with the same people, places and look every time, right inside Relume.

Most AI image tools give you one great picture, then the face changes, the room moves and everything starts looking generic.

Studio fixes that: lock it in once, and every image after stays true.

</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold"> → Styles lock the look. </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">Framing, eye line and tone, across photography, illustration, graphics and mocks.
</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold"> → Characters lock the people.</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> A few photos become a full reference sheet, so it’s the same face in every image.
</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold"> → Scenes lock the place. </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">One photo of your space becomes four locked angles.
</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">→ Everything lands straight in your Publish library.</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Ready to drop into your site

PS: Styles can be shared publicly, so you can use styles other Lumers have built or share your own.

You can watch the full demo here: </span><a href="https://youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE" target="_blank" rel="ugc nofollow noopener noreferrer" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_link text-blue-primary dark:text-dark-link hover:underline underline-offset-4">youtu.be/IE_U1aPYgNE</a><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
Learn more here: </span><a href="https://www.relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_link text-blue-primary dark:text-dark-link hover:underline underline-offset-4">relume.ai/whats-new/introducing-relume-studio</a><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">

Try it out and let us know what you think! </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Studio is included in your Relume Pro account</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4 space-y-2" data-testid="unfurls"><div class="relative w-full aspect-video overflow-hidden bg-gray-200 rounded-none sm:rounded-md"><img src="/api/video-thumbnails/youtube/IE_U1aPYgNE" alt="Video thumbnail" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerPolicy="no-referrer"/><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="flex items-center justify-center" style="width:9rem;height:9rem;border-radius:9999px;background-color:rgba(139, 139, 139, 0.2);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3)"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-white/80 border-t-transparent animate-spin"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[85px] -mt-[85px] bg-gradient-to-t from-background-card"></div><div class="text-link hover:text-link-hover w-full p-1 hover:cursor-pointer text-center">See more</div><div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t-2 border-card-border flex items-center space-x-2"><a title="6 comments" href="/x/announcements/msg_vOOOjvpY6HRq/introducing-relume-studio-now-included-in-relume-p#comments"><div class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-message mr-1"><path d="M8 9h8"></path><path d="M8 13h6"></path><path d="M18 4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1 -3 3h-5l-5 3v-3h-2a3 3 0 0 1 -3 -3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3 -3h12"></path></svg><span class="">6<span class="hidden sm:inline ml-1">Comment<!-- -->s</span></span></div></a><a title="19