Or would this be a pointless endeavour anyway?
Apologies if something similar already been asked, but I couldn’t find any references to the latest version of Client-first.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[85px] -mt-[85px] bg-gradient-to-t from-background-card"></div><div class="text-link hover:text-link-hover w-full p-1 hover:cursor-pointer text-center">See more</div><div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t-2 border-card-border flex items-center space-x-2"><a title="1 comment" href="/x/general/msg_mFwtGUeMYJ3n/will-relume-offer-native-integration-with-client-f#comments"><div class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-message mr-1"><path d="M8 9h8"></path><path d="M8 13h6"></path><path d="M18 4a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1 -3 3h-5l-5 3v-3h-2a3 3 0 0 1 -3 -3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3 -3h12"></path></svg><span class="">1<span class="hidden sm:inline ml-1">Comment</span></span></div></a><button class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3" title="Share" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_t8d5bsnrisnnibtb_" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-share-3 mr-1"><path d="M13 4v4c-6.575 1.028 -9.02 6.788 -10 12c-.037 .206 5.384 -5.962 10 -6v4l8 -7l-8 -7"></path></svg><span class="">Share</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rounded-sm sm:rounded-card border bg-background-card shadow-sm hover:shadow-md word-break-and-wrap border-card-accent" data-testid="feed-post-snippet"><div class="p-5 relative px-5 pt-5 pb-2 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-3"><div class="sm:flex items-center sm:space-y-0