width=2048,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_72.png 2048w, https://cdn.tightknit.ai/cdn-cgi/image/width=3840,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_72.png 3840w" src="https://cdn.tightknit.ai/cdn-cgi/image/width=3840,format=auto,quality=85/https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2026-10-21/12369558667202_b2ddf0e6aeff4ffa2af9_72.png"/></span><span class="font-medium text-link hover:text-link-hover hover:underline">Arman M.</span></a></div><span>·</span><div class="animate-pulse rounded-md bg-skeleton h-4 w-[100px] rounded-card"></div><span>·</span><div><button title="View message in Slack" class="w-full plausible-event-name=tk-slack-permalink-click plausible-event-location=post-in-feed plausible-event-permalink=https://relumecommunity.slack.com/archives/C02MRTJJEM9/p1793619448016149" data-testid="slack-permalink-button"><div title="View message in Slack" class="flex items-center p-1 hover:opacity-80"><img alt="Slack logo" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-5 h-5" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 1x, https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg 2x" src="https://assets.tightknit.ai/slack-logo.svg"/><span class="hidden">View in Slack</span></div></button></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 mt-4"><h2 class="pr-0 sm:pr-2 md:pr-10"><a class="font-medium text-neutral-header hover:text-neutral-header-hover text-2xl" href="/x/announcements/msg_gnsU6OfLblve/big-relume-ai-upgrade-faster-models-and-more-than">Big Relume AI upgrade: faster models and more than double the usage on Pro plans</a></h2></div><div class="max-h-[700px] body overflow-y-hidden"><div class="message-body relative w-full" data-testid="slack-blocks-body"><div id="slack_blocks_to_jsx" data-theme="light" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx relative flex gap-2 w-full max-w-[600px] styles_disabled"><div class="flex flex-col w-full"><div class="slack_blocks_to_jsx--blocks"><div class="text-base slack_blocks_to_jsx--block_wrapper break-words font-normal dark:text-dark-text-primary dark:bg-dark-bg-primary"><div id="GWPPH" class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_broadcast slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_broadcast">@<!-- -->channel</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Hey Lumers, I&#x27;m excited to share we&#x27;ve just rolled out a big upgrade to Relume AI:</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold"> Faster and better models across Publish and Export, and more than double the usage on every Pro plan</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">⚡</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">

Behind the scenes, we&#x27;ve been working closely with the leading AI labs and providers to unlock better performance and access to the latest frontier models at scale. Rather than relying on one model, we pick the best one for each job from across those labs, whether that&#x27;s reading your existing site, writing copy or generating images. We run thousands of evals to make that call, so you keep getting the best experience possible.

</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Updates to Relume Publish</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
</span></p><div class="flex gap-2 slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_list_element"><ul class="list-none"><li class="flex" style="margin-left:0"><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span></span><div style="margin-left:6px"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Faster, better models for everyone -</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Free and Pro plans both get upgraded models. Our Premium models are now 2–3× faster, and as before, Pro plans have it on by default </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">🚀</span></span></p></div></li><li class="flex" style="margin-left:0"><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span></span><div style="margin-left:6px"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Double the usage - </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">We&#x27;ve more than doubled the AI usage on every Pro plan, so you can build, tweak and iterate more than ever. Running low on usage? Our new model picker lets you switch to Standard so your usage goes even further </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">📈</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span></p></div></li></ul></div><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
I want to make sure you all get to experience these improvements ASAP so I&#x27;ve gone ahead and reset the usage limits on every Pro plan (Don&#x27;t tell </span><a class="slack_user word-break-and-wrap hover:underline slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_link" href="/members/prof_2L4xbAxXpsEZ">Dan</a><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">🤫</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">)

</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Updates to Relume Export</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
</span></p><div class="flex gap-2 slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_list_element"><ul class="list-none"><li class="flex" style="margin-left:0"><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span></span><div style="margin-left:6px"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">Improved output across all tasks -</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Output quality across all tasks is up by 30%+ on our evaluation criteria </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">💪🏼</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span></p></div></li><li class="flex" style="margin-left:0"><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span></span><div style="margin-left:6px"><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text font-semibold">AI performance now 3x to 5× faster -</span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> Sitemaps, wireframes, copy, and styles now generate in a fraction of the time. To visualise the difference I&#x27;ve attached a sped-up gif of wireframing before and after </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">⚡</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span></p></div></li></ul></div><p class="block slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element"><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text">
Jump in and give it a go. We can&#x27;t wait to see what you build with it </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">❤️</span></span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_text"> </span><span class="slack_blocks_to_jsx__rich_text_section_element_emoji"><span data-state="closed" data-testid="inline-emoji" class="hover:cursor-default word-break-and-wrap">🚀</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative h-[85px] -mt-[85px] bg-gradient-to-t from-background-card"></div><span class="flex text-neutral-primary-light text-sm items-center my-3 hover:cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-paperclip w-4 h-4 mr-1"><path d="M15 7l-6.5 6.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 3 3l6.5 -6.5a3 3 0 0 0 -6 -6l-6.5 6.5a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 9 9l6.5 -6.5"></path></svg> <!-- -->1<!-- --> <!-- -->attachment<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-arrows-vertical w-4 h-4 ml-1"><path d="M8 7l4 -4l4 4"></path><path d="M8 17l4 4l4 -4"></path><path d="M12 3l0 18"></path></svg></span><div class="text-link hover:text-link-hover w-full p-1 hover:cursor-pointer text-center">See more</div><div class="mt-4 pt-2 border-t-2 border-card-border flex items-center space-x-2"><a title="3 comments" href="/x/announcements/msg_gnsU6OfLblve/big-relume-ai-upgrade-faster-models-and-more-than#comments"><div class="flex items-center rounded-pill hover:bg-background-card-hover p-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width